%% Один ход диалога в веб-чате. В solution.py нет Session Store и Brief.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Клиент
  participant API as Chat API
  participant TC as Turn Controller
  participant SS as Session Store
  participant EX as Extractor (LLM #1)
  participant RD as State Reducer
  participant SC as Product Scorer
  participant PO as Dialogue Policy
  participant KR as Knowledge Request
  participant RK as Retrieve Knowledge
  participant RS as Responder (LLM #2 / шаблон)
  participant BR as Brief Renderer

  C->>API: сообщение
  API->>TC: handle_turn(session_id, text)
  TC->>SS: load(session_id)
  SS-->>TC: ConversationState
  TC->>EX: history + state + каталог полей
  EX-->>TC: Extraction (intent, поля с цитатой, mentions, search_query)
  TC->>RD: apply(state, extraction)
  RD-->>TC: state' (без неподтверждённых полей, единицы приведены)
  TC->>SC: score(state', rules)
  SC-->>TC: ScoreBoard (P по 6 продуктам, исключения, трасса)
  TC->>PO: decide(state', extraction, board)
  PO-->>TC: PolicyDecision (переход, need_facts, next_slot, offer_contact)
  TC->>KR: build_query(extraction, state', board, decision)
  KR-->>TC: KnowledgeQuery (кортеж сниппетов)
  TC->>RK: RetrieveKnowledge(query)
  alt need_facts
    RK-->>TC: KnowledgeResult (ranked + pinned + fallback, below_floor)
  else только ответ на анкету
    RK-->>TC: KnowledgeResult (только by_id: карточка лидера / 03 / 02, без моделей)
  end
  TC->>RS: ReplyPlan (вопрос?, evidence, ask, offer_contact)
  RS-->>TC: Reply
  opt dialog_to == SUBMITTED
    TC->>BR: build(state', board, contact)
    BR-->>TC: Lead (текст + JSON) → LeadSink
  end
  TC->>SS: save(state', trace)
  TC-->>API: Reply
  API-->>C: ответ (SSE)
